# ── Supabase ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Project Settings → Database → Connection string → "URI" (postgres.xxx...)
# 3. Project Settings → API → project URL + service_role key
# 4. Copy this file to .env and paste the values below.
#    When DATABASE_URL is set, the app uses Supabase; without it, local SQLite.

DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.XXXXXX:YOUR-PASSWORD@db.XXXXXX.supabase.co:5432/postgres
SUPABASE_URL=https://XXXXXX.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJhbGciOi...your-service-role-key...
